 "marks": [
  {
   "d": "2021-12-01",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "With sustained house price inflation and active management of cost and supply chain pressures, the Company continues to trade in line with market expectations for FY2022.",
   "file": "20211201_SPR_Acquisition-of-Tulloch-Homes-and-Proposed-Placing.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-02-22",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We entered the second half on track for strong growth for FY 2022 in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20220222_SPR_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-06-22",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "For the year to 31 May 2022, the Group expects to report results in line with market expectations, with good revenue growth and a better-than-expected reduction in net debt to c. £39.0m at year end (30 November 2021: £43.0m).",
   "file": "20220622_SPR_Acquisition-of-Scottish-housebuilding-business.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-20",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "While the challenging economic backdrop will impact our affordable and PRS housing activity in the short term as we await decisions from the Scottish Government, we are on track to deliver another year of revenue and profit growth overall.",
   "file": "20220920_SPR_Final-Results-and-Publication-of-Annual-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-12-12",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "These factors are expected to combine to impact the Group's margin and, as a result, the Group now expects to report profit before tax for FY 2023 below that of FY 2022.",
   "file": "20221212_SPR_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-02-21",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "In addition, with the actions that the Group is taking in response to the challenging market conditions, the Group is confident that it will be able to manage the inflationary pressures and report profit for the full year to 31 May 2023 in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20230221_SPR_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-19",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Group expects to report profit before tax for 2023 in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20230719_SPR_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-09-20",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "Accordingly, for FY 2024, the Group now expects to report adjusted profit before tax of c. £10m-£14m and is planning to reduce net debt to c. £55m by 31 May 2024.",
   "file": "20230920_SPR_Final-Results-and-Publication-of-Annual-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-12-13",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "While there remains uncertainty in the near-term market, the Group is confident of meeting market expectations for the year to 31 May 2024, with growth anticipated in H2 over H1 across the business, in line with usual seasonality, and with a significant contribution from land sales.",
   "file": "20231213_SPR_Trading-Update.md",
   "gnote": "early signal: first step up in tone"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-02-20",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Group remains on track to report results for the year to 31 May 2024 in line with market expectations, including a reduction in net bank debt to c. £55.0m.",
   "file": "20240220_SPR_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-07-11",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "Profit before tax is expected to be slightly ahead of market expectations due to good profits being realised on the land sales.",
   "file": "20240711_SPR_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-09-17",
   "doc": "FY R",
